      text: <p><span style="color:#1E2761;font-size:16px;font-weight:700">核心目标 · 保留条纹，去除高光</span></p>
    sourceLayout: e18517bd263236d4666721f3f7fc042abd49f759f4c682d12dcd245c9ebd9c38
  - elementId: slide-4-node-112-Text-8
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 50.4
      - 147.6
      - 410.4
      - 345.6
    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 13
      color: '#1F2937'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:13px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">去除局部饱和与强反光</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · 同时尽可能保留条纹连续性、边缘位置和灰度结构</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · 输出 r 不是“全图变暗”，而是恢复后续相位解算可用的条纹</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:6px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:13px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">同时输出 b/g/s 的原因</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · b 解释“被移除了哪些亮度”，提供物理减法路径</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · g 提供边界先验，强化条纹/高光边缘的恢复</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · s 提供高光位置先验，参与增强层与主解码门控</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:6px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:13px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">为何需要 r_direct + r_sub 双路径</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · r_sub = clamp(x - b) 保留物理含义，但暗区易丢细节</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · r_direct 由解码器直接预测，作为暗部和困难区域兜底</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · 两路用可学习 α 自适应融合，再用残差头做 ±0.15 微调</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 1afb85dc21b506c94c04939bef6185a12a8cd0b5ae819f9c7cf8b2e63680d2df
